==Acquisition==
The mod can be bought from [[Master Teasonai]] for {{sc|20,000}} after reaching '''Rank 3 - Trusted''' with the [[Ostron]]s.

==Notes==
*Does not affect Health-to-Energy conversion effects such as {{M|Equilibrium}} or [[Violet Archon Shard]]<nowiki/>s.
*Additional health is added after the increased Health Orb Effectiveness from {{Resource|Amber Archon Shard}}s and {{M|Mending Shot}}, but before the increase from {{WF|Dagath}}'s Passive.
*Additional health recovered is applied twice for companions.

